{"unit_id":"Chi-hong22__dsh-session-autoname#card-zh","repo":"Chi-hong22/dsh-session-autoname","commit":"79ec43bc302fbe84a1dad27648c24800c212041c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@chi-hong22/dsh-session-autoname 是一款 DSH 会话管理插件：按会话内容生成 MMDD｜类型｜主题格式的标题。它注册会话标题提供方，由 DSH 在每条人类提示时调度；插件会读取对话中的提示、助手结果和工具调用，首轮结束后修正占位标题，也会为已使用的分支会话保留分支编号。主要功能包括持续自动命名、按需总结指定会话、列出和检查会话标题，以及启动后的有限补扫。适合希望会话列表标题整齐、便于识别任务的 DSH 用户。安装为 profile bundle；标题生成使用当前会话模型路由。","source":"generated","evidence":["session-naming.js:718-743","session-naming.js:647-716","session-naming.js:1149-1182","session-naming.js:813-938","cordis.patch.yml:15-20"]}
{"unit_id":"Chi-hong22__dsh-session-autoname#card-en","repo":"Chi-hong22/dsh-session-autoname","commit":"79ec43bc302fbe84a1dad27648c24800c212041c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"@chi-hong22/dsh-session-autoname titles DSH sessions as MMDD｜type｜topic. It uses conversation and tool activity to generate titles, corrects first turn placeholders, preserves branch numbers, and supports naming a selected session or a bounded startup catch up. Install as a profile bundle.","source":"generated","evidence":["session-naming.js:718-743","session-naming.js:647-716","session-naming.js:1149-1182","session-naming.js:813-938","cordis.patch.yml:15-20"]}
