{"unit_id":"Chi-hong22__dsh-session-autoname#feature-1","repo":"Chi-hong22/dsh-session-autoname","commit":"79ec43bc302fbe84a1dad27648c24800c212041c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@chi-hong22/dsh-session-autoname 的功能「自动会话命名」：按对话记录生成 MMDD｜类型｜主题标题。DSH 在每条人类提示时触发标题提供方，首轮尚无助手结果时先写占位标题，再于 turn/end 后修正。","source":"generated","evidence":["session-naming.js:647-716","session-naming.js:718-743","session-naming.js:752-780"]}
{"unit_id":"Chi-hong22__dsh-session-autoname#feature-2","repo":"Chi-hong22/dsh-session-autoname","commit":"79ec43bc302fbe84a1dad27648c24800c212041c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@chi-hong22/dsh-session-autoname 的功能「指定会话命名」：管理工具可读取一个指定会话的完整历史并生成规范标题；可先 dry_run 预览，或直接写入。","source":"generated","evidence":["session-naming.js:1149-1182"]}
{"unit_id":"Chi-hong22__dsh-session-autoname#feature-3","repo":"Chi-hong22/dsh-session-autoname","commit":"79ec43bc302fbe84a1dad27648c24800c212041c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@chi-hong22/dsh-session-autoname 的功能「启动补扫」：插件启动后检查有限时间范围内的会话，对缺少合规标题或仍保留占位名的已完成对话触发标题刷新。","source":"generated","evidence":["session-naming.js:813-938"]}
{"unit_id":"Chi-hong22__dsh-session-autoname#feature-4","repo":"Chi-hong22/dsh-session-autoname","commit":"79ec43bc302fbe84a1dad27648c24800c212041c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@chi-hong22/dsh-session-autoname 的功能「分支标题」：分支会话完成自己的首轮工作后重新生成标题，并将继承的编号保留在标题末尾。","source":"generated","evidence":["session-naming.js:782-803","session-naming.js:618-640"]}
{"unit_id":"Chi-hong22__dsh-session-autoname#caveat-1","repo":"Chi-hong22/dsh-session-autoname","commit":"79ec43bc302fbe84a1dad27648c24800c212041c","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"@chi-hong22/dsh-session-autoname 使用前须知：它与官方随对话更新标题插件争用唯一标题提供方槽位，需二选一；首轮标题先显示占位名，助手完成后才会修正。","source":"generated","evidence":["session-naming.js:718-743","session-naming.js:647-716"]}
